  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive quality education and lifelong learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marginalised and disadvantaged children and adolescents enjoy inclusive quality education for lifelong learning. The program work to ensure access to public services for vulnerable groups and strengthen civil society organisations to hold governments responsible for human rights and ensure inclusive participation of citizens in decision-making. It has measures to ensure inclusion of persons with disability in all their activities. Gender equality is explicitly promoted in the activity and girls/women&#x2019;s access to services promoted. The program aims to contribute to reduced social and economic inequalities between men/boys and girls/women.</narrative>
  </description>
